---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CTA from "@/components/sections/CTA.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about Viona's mission to help creators make better explainer videos with AI."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-40">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6">
          You Explain It.
          <br /><span class="text-brand">We Illustrate It.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">
          Viona transforms talking-head videos into visually-rich content that actually helps viewers understand.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="space-y-12">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">The Problem</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Explainer videos are powerful—but creating them is painful. You spend hours editing,
            searching for stock footage, and adding graphics that never quite match what you're
            saying. The result? Generic videos that don't help your audience learn.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Our Solution</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Viona listens to your video, understands what you're explaining, and automatically
            generates relevant visuals—flowcharts when you describe a process, charts when you
            mention data, diagrams when you explain concepts. Not generic B-roll, but contextual
            graphics synced perfectly to your narration.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">The Technology</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
            At the core of Viona is an AI pipeline that goes beyond simple transcription. Our
            system performs deep content analysis to understand not just what you are saying, but
            what you mean. It identifies when you are describing a process, comparing options,
            presenting data, or walking through a concept—and selects the right visual format
            for each moment.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Transcription happens at the word level with precise timing, allowing us to remove
            filler words like "um" and "uh" without disrupting the flow. Visuals are generated
            contextually, meaning a mention of growth metrics produces a chart, not a random
            stock image of a graph. Every graphic is timed to appear exactly when you reference
            it, creating a seamless viewing experience that feels intentionally designed rather
            than algorithmically assembled.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Who We Help</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Course creators, educators, consultants, and thought leaders who want to produce
            professional explainer videos without spending hours in editing software. If you
            can explain something on camera, Viona can help you visualize it.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Online course creators use Viona to turn lecture recordings into engaging lesson
            content that students actually watch to the end. Consultants and coaches transform
            their frameworks and methodologies into polished videos they can share with clients
            or publish as thought leadership. Educators at schools and universities produce
            instructional material that meets students where they are—on video—without needing
            a production team. Marketing teams repurpose webinar recordings and internal
            presentations into shareable content that communicates complex ideas clearly.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">How It Works</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Upload your video. Our AI transcribes it with word-level accuracy, removes filler
            words like "um" and "uh", and analyzes your content to identify opportunities for
            visuals. You review what the AI generates, make any tweaks, style your subtitles,
            and export a polished video in any format.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Our Values</h2>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-medium mb-2">Context Over Clips</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
                We believe visuals should serve your message, not distract from it. Every graphic
                Viona generates is chosen because it helps the viewer understand what you are
                explaining—not because it fills space on screen. Generic stock footage is the
                enemy of comprehension, and we refuse to settle for it.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-medium mb-2">Creator-First</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
                You know your subject better than any algorithm. Viona is a tool that amplifies
                your expertise, not one that replaces your judgment. Our AI makes suggestions
                and you stay in control of the final result. We design every feature around
                saving you time while keeping you in the driver's seat.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-medium mb-2">Quality Over Speed</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
                We would rather produce one excellent video than ten mediocre ones. Our rendering
                pipeline prioritizes output quality—crisp subtitles, properly timed visuals, and
                clean exports—because your audience deserves content that looks as good as it sounds.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-medium mb-2">Accessible by Default</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
                Great explainer videos should be available to everyone, regardless of technical
                skill level. You should not need to learn After Effects or Premiere Pro to
                communicate your ideas visually. If you can record yourself talking, you have
                everything you need to get started.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTA />
</BaseLayout>
